FACTORYGUARD INDUSTRIAL SYSTEMS
EQUIPMENT MANUAL: CNC MACHINING CENTER REVISION 4

Model Series: FG-Precision-5X
Applicable Machines: CNC-01, CNC-02, CNC-03, CNC-04

1. OPERATIONAL SPECIFICATIONS
- Operating Voltage: 480 VAC +/- 10%, 3 Phase, 60 Hz
- Full Load Amps: 65 A
- Spindle Motor: 22 kW Continuous, 30 kW Peak
- Maximum Tool Weight: 8.0 kg (17.6 lbs)
- Maximum Tool Diameter: 90 mm (3.54 in)

2. TELEMETRY SENSOR LOCATIONS
- TE-101: Front Spindle Bearing RTD Pt100
- VE-201: Dual-Axis Piezoelectric Accelerometer on Spindle Nose
- PE-301: Through-Spindle Coolant Line Piezoresistive Transducer

For technical support or firmware diagnostics, consult the FactoryGuard Operations Portal.
